acky hotdogs of the apocalypse before orders expire and you become next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/9fe8402776bbcef43995580a163d7f68.poster.avif?t=1773377998\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/9fe8402776bbcef43995580a163d7f68.webm?t=1773377998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/9fe8402776bbcef43995580a163d7f68.mp4?t=1773377998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with your trusty weapon and serve justice against raiders who are after your profits. But don't forget what's on the stove!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/33acbc8993984d9c30002b68945f6e88.poster.avif?t=1773377998\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/33acbc8993984d9c30002b68945f6e88.webm?t=1773377998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846290/extras/33acbc8993984d9c30002b68945f6e88.mp4?t=1773377998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your equipment and diner to deal with the increasing chaos of the apocalypse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose Upgrades for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking Equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Diner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Handy Weapon</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinl